@startuml Activity_Diagram_UC04
title Activity Diagram: UC-04 Manage Cake Design

|Customer|
start
:Select "Design" from the navigation bar;
:Enter design preferences (text, flavor, size, colors, occasion, decorations);
|AI System|
if (Required design parameters complete?) then (Yes)
  :Generate one or more visual preview images;
  :Display generated preview(s) to customer;
  |Customer|
  :Review design preview(s);
  if (Customer wants to ask a clarifying question?) then (Yes)
    |AI System|
    :Open chatbot for clarification;
    |Customer|
    :Ask a clarifying question;
    |AI System|
    :Answer question and keep customer on current design page;
  else (No)
    |Customer|
    :Request design adjustments;
    |AI System|
    :Regenerate updated preview(s);
    :Display updated preview(s) to customer;
  endif
  |Customer|
  :Approve final preferred design;
  :Select "Add to Cart" or "Order This Design";
  |System|
  :Create order from approved design;
  :Notify Staff/Admin that custom design is ready for feasibility review;
  |Staff/Admin|
  :Review design against ingredient availability and preparation feasibility;
  |System|
  if (Design feasible?) then (Yes)
    :Update design status to "Approved";
    :Attach finalized design to order;
    :Proceed to Manage Order use case;
  else (No)
    :Update design status to "Declined - Design Not Possible";
    :Notify customer with reasons and alternative suggestions;
  endif
else (No)
  |AI System|
  :Prompt for missing or unclear information;
  :Suggest available alternatives;
  |Customer|
  :Correct input and resubmit design request;
endif

stop
@enduml
